泊まり早くしようね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎\nみりターン\n◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆーたんたん⊿牛タンタンさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛はお肉派らしいけど好きなお肉は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→豚肉、鶏肉が好きです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れんれんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・お願いしたら塩対応してくれますか？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→もちろん塩対応しますよ＼(^o^)／笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛知のコウジ（のぎざか会）さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・疲れている時のリフレッシュ方法は何かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→お風呂に長時間入る！\n音楽をひたすら聴く！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けんけんぱさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・みり愛は何月が苦手？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→7〜8月かな...\n日差しが強いと必ず頭痛くなって\n体調崩しやすいので苦手です(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"tomoさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・個握に生誕Tシャツ着て行ったら変ですかね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→むしろ着てきてる方たくさんいます！\n着てきてくださるのすごく嬉しい(^ ^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただゆきさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・授業中最近すごく眠くなるけどなにか対策とかありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→私も眠くなっちゃう(>_<)\nぺしぺし自分を叩き起こします。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりあんさーは圧倒的お肉派が\n多かったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お肉love。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のみりあんさーはお休みします。"},{"type":"break"}